<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Iron Master - 125,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $4.95 fio scale load/40,000 shinc 15-30/9 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Bona Fountain - 72,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Ghent $5.75 fio six days shinc 10-16/9 Sidmar.</p>
<p>ORE - Hassbat Qatar - 130,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Rotterdam and Antwerp about $6 fio 50,000 shinc/40,000 shinc Sep Bocimar.</p>
</text>
